# Raw source material for the site's scroll-scrubbed sections — each is a
# disposable intermediate (a full-size PNG sequence, or a single source
# video) that gets converted to a much smaller compressed video under R2
# (see the ffmpeg -g 8 -keyint_min 8 commands in the relevant commit —
# previously a WebP sequence under web/public/ via
# web/scripts/convert-*-frames.mjs, before the canvas-frames-to-video
# rework); that converted output is what the site actually serves and is
# what's committed, not these.
choose-your-escape-frames/
Hero-page-entrance-frames/
hero-bg-frames-replace.mp4
hero-section-video-change.mp4
bamboo-dinner-frames/
logo-video.mp4
logo-video.gif
